    "name":  "Black LED Wall Light - LERUM - For E27 LED",
    "reference":  "91739",
    "short_description":  null,
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"margin:0px 0px 24px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003eBlack LED Wall Light LERUM\u0026nbsp;with Wooden Base for E27 Bulbs\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eModern, natural lighting for any space\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eBlack LED wall light\u003c/strong\u003e with a \u003cstrong\u003ewooden base\u003c/strong\u003e for \u003cstrong\u003eE27\u003c/strong\u003e bulbs is a modern and\u0026nbsp;natural choice for any interior space. Its minimalist, timeless design suits any decorating style, from classic to contemporary. The \u003cstrong\u003elampshade\u003c/strong\u003e has a cone shape with a \u003cstrong\u003e120º\u003c/strong\u003e beam angle, spreading light evenly and\u0026nbsp;lighting\u0026nbsp;a larger area.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eThe wall light is made from\u0026nbsp;high-quality aluminium and wood, with a \u003cstrong\u003ematt black\u003c/strong\u003e finish that gives it a modern, sophisticated look. The wooden base adds a natural, warm touch to the design. Both the lampshade and its fittings are matt black, keeping the main colour of this \u003cstrong\u003ewall lamp\u003c/strong\u003e consistent.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eThe wall light takes bulbs with an \u003cstrong\u003eE27 lamp holder\u003c/strong\u003e, so you can choose the one that best suits your lighting needs. Filament bulbs are an ideal option, as they\u0026nbsp;create warm, pleasant atmospheres with a vintage look.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eFeatures:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"margin:4px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eNatural and\u0026nbsp;modern design\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eMade from\u0026nbsp;high-quality aluminium and wood\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eMatt black finish\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eWooden base\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eBlack fittings\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eTakes E27 bulbs\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4 style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eBenefits:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"margin:4px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eModern and\u0026nbsp;pleasant lighting\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eAdapts to any decorating style\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eEasy to install\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eSaves energy\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eInstallation:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eDrill two holes in the wall matching the spacing of the holes in the base.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003ePosition the light and fit it to the base.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eConnect the power cable.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eUse the screws to fix it to the wall.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eFit a bulb with an E27 lamp holder. Flip the switch to test the light.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eUses for the Black LED Wall Light LERUM\u0026nbsp;with Wooden Base for E27 Bulbs\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"margin:4px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eKitchen\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eDining room\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eLiving room\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eBedroom\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eOffice\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eHallways\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eEntrances\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e",
